                },
                {
                    "no": 9,
                    "code": "Low Occupancy - all caribbean destinations",
                    "description": "Low Occupancy - all caribbean destinations",
                    "note": "​Please note that during travel periods of low occupancy, hotels will often reduce\n the ​​number of restaurants open on a daily basis. Instead, restaurants will be \navailable on a rotational basis to ensure passengers can still enjoy the resorts \nbreadth of cuisine options during their stay. ​\n\nSpecific restaurant details will be provided locally in resort upon arrival, subject to\nchange.",
                    "dateModified": "2022-02-25T16:59:41",
