                    "code": "OODR VA flights",
                    "description": "OODR VA flights",
                    "note": "Flight details such as departure time and flight number for bookings made \noutside of 11 months of the departure date are guidelines only and as such \nare subject to change when the flight schedule is confirmed within 331 days \nof departure.",
